{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Obakeyashiki&quot; is a first-person exploration adventure game where you search for an exit from a maze-like haunted house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2015\u2015 &quot;Welcome to the haunted house.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You visit a mansion that has been turned entirely into a haunted house by its owner, who built it to entertain visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2015\u2015 &quot;I've prepared five exits.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you step inside, you can't leave until you find one of the exits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of the five possible exits, one has a guided path prepared for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To find the others, you\u2019ll need to leave the main path and explore the maze-like house on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No combat. No game over. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD \u2014 Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left Click \u2014 Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tab \u2014 Inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Esc \u2014 Settings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776410?t=1748617808","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776410?t=1748617808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776410/733d4bf59a98c269eafad666d77f242bab34e69f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748617808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776410/733d4bf59a98c269eafad666d77f242bab34e69f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748617808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Obakeyashiki&quot; is a first-person exploration adventure game where you search for an exit from a maze-like haunted house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2015\u2015 &quot;Welcome to the haunted house.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You visit a mansion that has been turned entirely into a haunted house by its owner, who built it to entertain visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2015\u2015 &quot;I've prepared five exits.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you step inside, you can't leave until you find one of the exits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of the five possible exits, one has a guided path prepared for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To find the others, you\u2019ll need to leave the main path and explore the maze-like house on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No combat. No game over. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD \u2014 Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left Click \u2014 Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tab \u2014 Inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Esc \u2014 Settings</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","developers":["Gattorocco"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776410/50b8cca750622f4dcb0ef8b6c6c44156fafb19e6/header.jpg?t=1748617808","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257147140,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147140/movie480.mp4?t=1748617805","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147140/movie_max.mp4?t=1748617805"},"name":"obakeyashiki_m","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.ste